ng vintage objects, photographs and ephemera, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YKCKvS4B9o8Q7kNvwHCQSiU&_nc_oc=AdkTjmiovAxG_7XOINv7Ar8S-tuPVf4iamvhkr8uXGBpNgBZaj_nJ9qOh0asY0TL__0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftQxeHhduz6h7vND6q8eg3AJFrFqVH3HuKlQZXw0wTUFg&oe=69A81501"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eY-MtTfXZgAQ7kNvwF0gsaH&_nc_oc=AdlwnV4cmiPuWWVFrDzAvmrejQUfBVNIo-0hn3CnRJCV5zF2FJj0zA9d2fTrxJm3ebE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afu29gWCNKDr2olJU7QOUSTBHK5gANUGP2JWRUEoJ0epsw&oe=69A82266"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8WFuIyPMwEgQ7kNvwG-Ieht&_nc_oc=AdnxTLyUE1X_QQmsy42je9ng-f9-Z-4H5y-8BZCUaH4Lkvc4UOZNPLC_sJbYDEB9JEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss